Uwe
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 2 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF

CUIF 5 FACE_HALF
CUIF 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
CUIF 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE CUIF CUIF
AND
    DEST Empty
    OR
        DESTSRC Suit match
        SRC Rank K
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
DESTSRC Suit match_color
$win
PILE ALL CUIF Empty
